1
00:00:00,006 --> 00:00:01,552
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,554 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,493 --> 00:00:05,526
I told you not to let this happen.

4
00:00:05,709 --> 00:00:07,210
I told you I didn't want this!

5
00:00:07,978 --> 00:00:09,713
You've completely lost your mind!

6
00:00:10,053 --> 00:00:11,315
Just stop it!

7
00:00:15,372 --> 00:00:16,398
Move!

8
00:00:17,204 --> 00:00:18,442
Stop!

9
00:00:20,166 --> 00:00:21,166
Ji Hu.

10
00:00:21,168 --> 00:00:23,077
Don't you ever lay a hand on Ji Ni again.

11
00:00:23,805 --> 00:00:25,100
I won't let it slide.

12
00:00:26,205 --> 00:00:28,315
Who do you think you are,
hitting people like that?

13
00:00:28,812 --> 00:00:30,689
That's what your mom did to you.

14
00:00:30,713 --> 00:00:31,788
You hated it!

15
00:00:32,918 --> 00:00:34,788
So why are you doing it to someone else?

16
00:00:35,045 --> 00:00:36,045
Ji Hu.

17
00:00:36,459 --> 00:00:38,110
Ji Ni hit you.

18
00:00:38,865 --> 00:00:40,245
So why are you mad at me?

19
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,649
I was prepared to get hit.

20
00:00:42,158 --> 00:00:43,375
You got involved.

21
00:00:44,528 --> 00:00:45,528
What?

22
00:00:46,905 --> 00:00:48,636
You confessed knowing you'd get hit?

23
00:00:50,319 --> 00:00:51,319
Why?

24
00:00:52,284 --> 00:00:53,284
Why?

25
00:00:54,332 --> 00:00:55,561
Because I love her.

26
00:00:59,771 --> 00:01:00,828
Are you crazy?

27
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:02,047
I confessed,

28
00:01:03,051 --> 00:01:05,662
knowing it would make her mad.

29
00:01:07,518 --> 00:01:08,792
Even if she doesn't love me now,

30
00:01:10,275 --> 00:01:12,607
I hope she'll realize
how she feels someday.

31
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:16,867
And I hope those feelings will be for me.

32
00:01:20,068 --> 00:01:21,068
What about me?

33
00:01:22,035 --> 00:01:23,035
What about us?

34
00:01:23,607 --> 00:01:24,707
I told you.

35
00:01:25,731 --> 00:01:27,705
We need to break free from our parents.

36
00:01:28,651 --> 00:01:30,670
You wanted your parents to accept you,

37
00:01:31,488 --> 00:01:32,945
and I wanted to repay them.

38
00:01:34,805 --> 00:01:36,649
We mistook those feelings for love.

39
00:01:38,166 --> 00:01:40,474
- We were wrong.
- Call it a mistake or love.

40
00:01:40,949 --> 00:01:41,985
I don't care.

41
00:01:43,485 --> 00:01:45,726
Just this summer,
we were planning to get married.

42
00:01:46,692 --> 00:01:49,343
Na Ji Ni doesn't want you. Come to me!

43
00:01:50,952 --> 00:01:52,382
I've made my choice.

44
00:01:53,165 --> 00:01:55,421
If she insists on being alone, so will I.

45
00:01:56,692 --> 00:01:57,827
There's no second choice.

46
00:02:01,558 --> 00:02:03,278
You should find the right love
for yourself too.

47
00:02:33,672 --> 00:02:34,765
You're back?

48
00:02:46,091 --> 00:02:47,968
Ji Hu, it's me.

49
00:02:48,050 --> 00:02:49,496
I'm coming in for a moment.

50
00:02:53,412 --> 00:02:55,332
I'm sorry. I've already gone to bed.

51
00:02:56,747 --> 00:02:59,145
Okay. Get some rest.

52
00:03:02,324 --> 00:03:04,090
You're our first customer today.

53
00:03:04,115 --> 00:03:06,111
- Take your time looking around.
- Okay.

54
00:03:09,911 --> 00:03:11,392
May I see this one?

55
00:03:14,447 --> 00:03:15,553
Thank you.

56
00:03:20,385 --> 00:03:21,747
The person who keeps me alive.

57
00:03:23,265 --> 00:03:24,326
So,

58
00:03:25,583 --> 00:03:27,236
the person I can't help but love.

59
00:03:29,555 --> 00:03:30,555
It's you, Ji Ni.

60
00:03:32,857 --> 00:03:35,502
- I'll take this one.
- Sure. I'll wrap it up for you.

61
00:03:40,885 --> 00:03:41,892
Yeah, Tae O.

62
00:03:42,518 --> 00:03:43,518
America?

63
00:03:46,658 --> 00:03:47,658
Okay.

64
00:03:48,146 --> 00:03:49,146
Yeah.

65
00:04:02,591 --> 00:04:05,904
Why did you do it yourself?
I was going to do that for you.

66
00:04:06,637 --> 00:04:08,730
I told you I'm not big on birthdays.

67
00:04:08,959 --> 00:04:10,630
Why do you never listen to me?

68
00:04:11,371 --> 00:04:12,985
If your dad were here,

69
00:04:13,010 --> 00:04:16,235
he'd make such a huge fuss
over your birthday.

70
00:04:18,212 --> 00:04:19,745
My daughter.

71
00:04:19,770 --> 00:04:22,371
Thank you for being born to me.

72
00:04:23,465 --> 00:04:25,301
You're my reason for living.

73
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:27,258
- You're pretty.
- I said I don't want it.

74
00:04:27,283 --> 00:04:29,872
- You're pretty.
- Seriously!

75
00:04:30,762 --> 00:04:33,157
- You little brat.
- She's scary.

76
00:04:33,867 --> 00:04:37,011
Scary, right? That little brat.

77
00:04:37,036 --> 00:04:38,692
She's only like this with me.

78
00:04:44,878 --> 00:04:46,012
Here's your gift.

79
00:04:48,369 --> 00:04:50,609
- Thank you.
- Happy birthday.

80
00:04:50,745 --> 00:04:53,377
- I hope you'll be a good daughter.
- Come on, Seung Hyun!

81
00:04:53,705 --> 00:04:55,376
There I go, nagging again.

82
00:04:55,673 --> 00:04:58,107
- Sorry.
- You did well.

83
00:04:58,302 --> 00:05:00,606
You should do that more often.

84
00:05:00,630 --> 00:05:01,630
What about you?

85
00:05:03,428 --> 00:05:05,431
- Happy birthday.
- Thank you.

86
00:05:11,317 --> 00:05:13,275
Let's eat.

87
00:05:13,589 --> 00:05:16,486
What a feast!

88
00:05:23,392 --> 00:05:24,424
Hey, wait.

89
00:05:27,231 --> 00:05:28,625
I can't top Seung Hyun's gift.

90
00:05:29,641 --> 00:05:31,052
You didn't have to get me anything.

91
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,036
Thank you.

92
00:05:36,071 --> 00:05:38,348
Why are there so many hair ties...

93
00:05:40,039 --> 00:05:41,039
To return the favor.

94
00:05:42,738 --> 00:05:45,767
Hey, what's wrong?
You don't look happy. It's your birthday.

95
00:05:46,091 --> 00:05:48,234
I've never really liked my birthday.

96
00:05:48,470 --> 00:05:49,540
You know that.

97
00:05:49,565 --> 00:05:51,897
Still, you should say "thank you"
to your mom.

98
00:05:52,706 --> 00:05:54,321
You're quoting a textbook.

99
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,720
Is it that obvious?

100
00:05:56,204 --> 00:05:58,195
I'll thank her when I'm 40 too.

101
00:05:58,491 --> 00:06:01,142
Hey, at least I don't glare as you do.

102
00:06:02,278 --> 00:06:03,416
But why?

103
00:06:03,792 --> 00:06:05,236
It's supposed to be a happy day.

104
00:06:06,012 --> 00:06:07,312
I was so insensitive.

105
00:06:07,595 --> 00:06:10,991
I blamed mom for marrying someone
without knowing if he'd stay or leave,

106
00:06:11,015 --> 00:06:12,706
and I gave her a hard time when he left.

107
00:06:12,731 --> 00:06:14,406
I was struggling with my injured leg too.

108
00:06:15,478 --> 00:06:18,947
My friends were singing farewell songs
before heading off to the army.

109
00:06:19,521 --> 00:06:20,808
I was at my lowest.

110
00:06:22,436 --> 00:06:24,227
- I'm sorry.
- Hey!

111
00:06:24,265 --> 00:06:26,012
I'm not telling you this
to get an apology.

112
00:06:26,285 --> 00:06:28,715
Just live your life. Like everyone else.

113
00:06:29,438 --> 00:06:32,341
At least smile and enjoy your birthday.

114
00:06:33,192 --> 00:06:37,161
I'll try to keep Seung Hyun's nagging
under control.

115
00:06:37,478 --> 00:06:41,090
They said he was diagnosed with PTSD
at the hospital.

116
00:06:41,188 --> 00:06:42,188
Try to understand.

117
00:06:43,987 --> 00:06:45,105
It's okay.

118
00:06:56,791 --> 00:06:59,413
I need to tell you something.

119
00:07:04,705 --> 00:07:07,297
It's a bit rude to show up
at someone's house this early.

120
00:07:07,382 --> 00:07:09,352
No, that's not what I meant.

121
00:07:09,852 --> 00:07:11,112
Ji Ni, it's not like that.

122
00:07:11,137 --> 00:07:12,627
I really came to talk to you.

123
00:07:13,692 --> 00:07:15,833
Could you talk to your brother for me?

124
00:07:18,032 --> 00:07:19,992
Go ahead. I'll be fine.

125
00:07:31,338 --> 00:07:32,830
You're going to America?

126
00:07:33,713 --> 00:07:34,799
Because of me?

127
00:07:34,824 --> 00:07:36,733
No, it's for my grandpa's funeral.

128
00:07:37,314 --> 00:07:39,179
I'm the only son in three generations,
so I grew up pretty spoiled.

129
00:07:39,811 --> 00:07:41,210
I told Ji Hu too.

130
00:07:41,521 --> 00:07:43,589
I see.

131
00:07:44,167 --> 00:07:45,468
When are you leaving?

132
00:07:45,612 --> 00:07:46,907
I'm on my way to the airport now.

133
00:07:46,932 --> 00:07:48,572
So you came here just to see me?

134
00:07:49,212 --> 00:07:51,817
I'm sorry I got the wrong idea.

135
00:07:52,485 --> 00:07:55,241
It's okay. I came to tell you something
before I leave.

136
00:07:56,824 --> 00:07:57,824
What is it?

137
00:07:57,992 --> 00:07:59,415
You like Ji Hu, don't you?

138
00:07:59,678 --> 00:08:00,882
But you're holding back, right?

139
00:08:02,019 --> 00:08:03,933
What are you talking about?

140
00:08:04,092 --> 00:08:06,202
You probably don't know
because you're inexperienced,

141
00:08:06,763 --> 00:08:08,656
I can tell. I've been through it.

142
00:08:08,664 --> 00:08:10,696
Well, I'm still going through it.

143
00:08:11,511 --> 00:08:14,091
He's trying hard not to fall in love too,

144
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:15,795
so he probably hasn't realized it yet.

145
00:08:16,465 --> 00:08:18,438
- Hey...
- I'll get you a birthday present...

146
00:08:18,604 --> 00:08:20,150
when I get back.

147
00:08:20,325 --> 00:08:21,710
It's a good thing you were born.

148
00:08:21,972 --> 00:08:23,923
Stop thinking
you shouldn't have been born.

149
00:08:24,151 --> 00:08:26,116
Think about who you really want.

150
00:08:26,524 --> 00:08:27,951
Think it over carefully.

151
00:08:29,232 --> 00:08:30,330
That's all I wanted to say!

152
00:08:33,899 --> 00:08:34,899
I'm off.

153
00:08:48,325 --> 00:08:50,319
What? You didn't go to work today?

154
00:08:50,696 --> 00:08:51,696
No.

155
00:08:52,105 --> 00:08:54,125
Everyone went to the book fair.

156
00:08:54,150 --> 00:08:55,265
You're not going?

157
00:08:56,008 --> 00:08:59,454
The booth is small,
so they only need three people.

158
00:09:00,491 --> 00:09:01,712
Thank goodness.

159
00:09:02,955 --> 00:09:06,044
I wasn't even involved
in preparing for it this time.

160
00:09:06,046 --> 00:09:07,415
I just made the merch.

161
00:09:08,631 --> 00:09:10,307
Still, though...

162
00:09:11,411 --> 00:09:13,505
What do you mean, thank goodness?

163
00:09:14,751 --> 00:09:15,909
The truth is...

164
00:09:16,394 --> 00:09:19,005
Ji Hu confessed his feelings
to me yesterday.

165
00:09:20,919 --> 00:09:23,246
I don't want to run into him for a while.

166
00:09:24,445 --> 00:09:26,983
I see.

167
00:09:27,771 --> 00:09:30,293
- Ji Hu confessed to...
- Jung A.

168
00:09:31,739 --> 00:09:33,827
Maybe I've really messed up my life.

169
00:09:34,598 --> 00:09:37,519
I've had one bombshell after another
since this morning.

170
00:09:38,969 --> 00:09:39,969
Where are you going?

171
00:09:41,184 --> 00:09:43,535
To the studio. I need to think.

172
00:09:51,311 --> 00:09:53,833
So Ji Hu confessed to her.

173
00:09:55,585 --> 00:09:57,832
What he told me over drinks that day...

174
00:10:02,051 --> 00:10:03,495
It was about Ji Ni again.

175
00:10:28,318 --> 00:10:29,639
I was so insensitive.

176
00:10:29,942 --> 00:10:33,125
I blamed mom for marrying someone
without knowing if he'd stay or leave,

177
00:10:33,368 --> 00:10:34,952
and I gave her a hard time when he left.

178
00:10:35,818 --> 00:10:37,417
I was struggling with my injured leg too.

179
00:10:38,358 --> 00:10:41,760
My friends were singing farewell songs
before heading off to the army.

180
00:10:44,354 --> 00:10:45,455
I'm sorry.

181
00:10:47,407 --> 00:10:48,642
I'm so sorry.

182
00:10:53,778 --> 00:10:55,479
Dad was really awful.

183
00:10:57,544 --> 00:10:58,544
But...

184
00:10:59,173 --> 00:11:01,317
how can someone like me shamelessly...

185
00:11:02,859 --> 00:11:05,080
smile on my own birthday?

186
00:11:05,732 --> 00:11:07,212
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

187
00:11:07,237 --> 00:11:10,076
Your mom and I love you so much.

188
00:11:10,341 --> 00:11:12,138
I wronged that other family,

189
00:11:12,885 --> 00:11:16,715
but I made my choice because I didn't want
to wrong you and your mom too.

190
00:11:18,959 --> 00:11:20,866
Do you know why all this happened?

191
00:11:21,159 --> 00:11:23,212
This happened
because we couldn't give you up.

192
00:11:23,792 --> 00:11:25,305
I shouldn't have been born.

193
00:11:27,845 --> 00:11:29,367
I'm a child of sin.

194
00:11:31,992 --> 00:11:33,541
No.

195
00:11:34,259 --> 00:11:35,681
No. Don't blame yourself.

196
00:11:35,705 --> 00:11:36,939
Blame me instead.

197
00:11:37,932 --> 00:11:40,011
Your mom is innocent too.
I'm the one at fault.

198
00:11:45,851 --> 00:11:47,210
You like Ji Hu, don't you?

199
00:11:47,532 --> 00:11:48,818
But you're holding back, right?

200
00:11:49,225 --> 00:11:51,445
You probably don't know
because you're inexperienced,

201
00:11:51,972 --> 00:11:53,106
but I can see right through you.

202
00:11:54,451 --> 00:11:56,256
No way.

203
00:11:56,892 --> 00:11:58,093
No way.

204
00:11:59,105 --> 00:12:00,943
I'm never falling in love. Ever.

205
00:12:01,425 --> 00:12:02,670
I'm not.

206
00:12:02,912 --> 00:12:04,468
I said I'm not!

207
00:12:04,492 --> 00:12:05,967
Seriously.

208
00:12:07,898 --> 00:12:09,461
Ji Ni, what's wrong?

209
00:12:12,229 --> 00:12:13,579
Why are you here?

210
00:12:13,971 --> 00:12:17,386
I thought this might
cheer you up a little.

211
00:12:18,132 --> 00:12:20,982
I'll get you a proper cake tonight,
and we can blow out the candles.

212
00:12:21,779 --> 00:12:22,779
It's okay.

213
00:12:23,085 --> 00:12:24,458
Let's just have a meal together.

214
00:12:24,483 --> 00:12:26,751
- No candles or anything.
- Right.

215
00:12:26,963 --> 00:12:28,471
Especially since Tae O
is going to America too.

216
00:12:29,498 --> 00:12:31,193
You had seaweed soup, right?

217
00:12:31,218 --> 00:12:33,207
- Your mom...
- I made it myself.

218
00:12:33,232 --> 00:12:34,463
I didn't want anyone
celebrating my birthday.

219
00:12:34,731 --> 00:12:37,011
That's so like you.

220
00:12:37,346 --> 00:12:39,479
It's your first birthday
since your dad passed away.

221
00:12:39,771 --> 00:12:42,151
If you act like this,
your mom will feel even lonelier.

222
00:12:50,532 --> 00:12:52,034
Why did he go to Dongdaemun?

223
00:12:53,245 --> 00:12:55,176
Were the clothes he bought me
from Dongdaemun?

224
00:12:55,671 --> 00:12:56,971
No.

225
00:12:57,192 --> 00:12:59,451
They're from a boutique in Buam Dong.

226
00:13:00,492 --> 00:13:02,538
One of the employees
was in a fashion show.

227
00:13:02,563 --> 00:13:05,445
But he was busy,
so he only sent flowers...

228
00:13:05,594 --> 00:13:08,290
- and didn't attend.
- What about the hotel?

229
00:13:09,565 --> 00:13:11,416
Who's the woman he met at the hotel?

230
00:13:11,844 --> 00:13:14,511
I'm not sure about that...

231
00:13:16,192 --> 00:13:17,874
Let's check the boutique first.

232
00:13:18,462 --> 00:13:19,562
Where in Buam Dong is it?

233
00:13:21,185 --> 00:13:22,255
But, ma'am,

234
00:13:22,908 --> 00:13:24,441
the General has recently been...

235
00:13:24,757 --> 00:13:27,667
looking into investing in a fashion brand
with an old acquaintance.

236
00:13:28,192 --> 00:13:30,654
He hasn't been seeing any women.

237
00:13:31,333 --> 00:13:32,507
Are you sure?

238
00:13:33,185 --> 00:13:36,071
- You're not lying to me, are you?
- Of course not, ma'am.

239
00:13:42,402 --> 00:13:43,461
No way.

240
00:13:43,486 --> 00:13:46,945
The general would never do something
as sleazy as Cha Min Ki...

241
00:13:48,146 --> 00:13:50,657
Lieutenant No, we're heading to the car.

242
00:13:50,682 --> 00:13:53,190
Drop her off, then take me
to Assemblyman Kim's office.

243
00:13:53,214 --> 00:13:54,903
Yes, sir. Understood.

244
00:13:55,358 --> 00:13:59,780
- But isn't this woman...
- What?

245
00:14:00,012 --> 00:14:01,734
I think I'd better just go on my own.

246
00:14:01,758 --> 00:14:02,842
I don't want to impose.

247
00:14:02,889 --> 00:14:05,294
You're not imposing.
We're going that way anyway.

248
00:14:05,296 --> 00:14:06,477
Don't worry. Come along.

249
00:14:18,427 --> 00:14:21,078
- The banh xeo here is so good.
- Thank you.

250
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,655
I think this place is a real hidden gem.

251
00:14:27,638 --> 00:14:30,173
- Thank you. Enjoy your meal.
- Thank you.

252
00:14:38,685 --> 00:14:39,685
Are you okay?

253
00:14:40,090 --> 00:14:41,793
Yes. What brings you here?

254
00:14:42,765 --> 00:14:46,355
I wanted to see you
and get some banh xeo to go.

255
00:14:46,675 --> 00:14:48,021
It's for Sa Bin's lunch.

256
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:51,445
Got it. I'll pack it up nicely for you.

257
00:14:59,892 --> 00:15:03,678
I like working here.
It helps me keep things simple.

258
00:15:04,892 --> 00:15:06,098
So don't worry too much.

259
00:15:06,978 --> 00:15:10,011
And I took the medicine
Sa Bin prescribed too.

260
00:15:10,438 --> 00:15:11,438
You did?

261
00:15:11,698 --> 00:15:13,038
Sa Bin will be glad to hear that.

262
00:15:19,243 --> 00:15:22,034
That looks delicious. Join me, Yeong Ju.

263
00:15:22,036 --> 00:15:24,211
I've already eaten plenty
at home, so I'm fine.

264
00:15:27,525 --> 00:15:30,537
Someone as wonderful as you
should be a parent,

265
00:15:30,717 --> 00:15:32,632
but I don't think I'm fit to be one.

266
00:15:33,655 --> 00:15:34,655
Where did that come from?

267
00:15:35,598 --> 00:15:38,539
Maybe things turned out this way
because I never had kids.

268
00:15:38,847 --> 00:15:39,847
You think so?

269
00:15:42,602 --> 00:15:43,798
It's okay.

270
00:15:45,442 --> 00:15:46,776
(Don't pick up)

271
00:15:48,365 --> 00:15:49,628
Hey, it's me.

272
00:15:52,372 --> 00:15:53,711
What?

273
00:15:55,755 --> 00:15:58,080
How could something like this happen?

274
00:15:59,891 --> 00:16:01,245
I don't know, either.

275
00:16:01,425 --> 00:16:03,457
I thought I was going to have
a heart attack and die.

276
00:16:03,625 --> 00:16:04,669
My goodness.

277
00:16:05,458 --> 00:16:07,363
Sa Bin's brother is Im Joong Bin?

278
00:16:07,365 --> 00:16:09,243
So did you two make a scene?

279
00:16:09,852 --> 00:16:11,158
Did Il Dong hit you again?

280
00:16:11,172 --> 00:16:12,172
No.

281
00:16:12,369 --> 00:16:14,993
He just glared daggers at me,

282
00:16:15,687 --> 00:16:17,710
then he read the room and kept quiet.

283
00:16:17,712 --> 00:16:19,486
So I pretended I didn't know, either.

284
00:16:19,894 --> 00:16:21,211
Good. You did the right thing.

285
00:16:22,412 --> 00:16:25,977
How on earth did you get so close
to my husband's brother?

286
00:16:25,978 --> 00:16:26,978
Tell me about it.

287
00:16:27,352 --> 00:16:30,022
They say when it rains, it pours.

288
00:16:30,465 --> 00:16:31,791
Seriously...

289
00:16:31,792 --> 00:16:33,745
Anyway, what's all this?

290
00:16:34,005 --> 00:16:37,112
Joong Bin gave it to me.
It's Ji Ni's birthday present.

291
00:16:37,945 --> 00:16:39,025
"Joong Bin?"

292
00:16:39,218 --> 00:16:40,218
You...

293
00:16:40,949 --> 00:16:43,019
- You didn't, did you?
- Yeong Ju!

294
00:16:43,718 --> 00:16:46,603
I haven't even been a widow for a year.

295
00:16:46,605 --> 00:16:50,006
And Ji Ni is furious, saying
she won't get married because of me.

296
00:16:50,007 --> 00:16:52,385
What kind of mother would I be
if I started dating someone now?

297
00:16:53,571 --> 00:16:55,687
Just keep your distance for now.

298
00:16:55,885 --> 00:16:57,413
My sister-in-law
is already looking into Joong Bin,

299
00:16:57,414 --> 00:16:59,393
because she thinks
he might have another woman.

300
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:01,460
What?

301
00:17:02,209 --> 00:17:03,916
This is unbelievable. Seriously.

302
00:17:05,538 --> 00:17:07,638
No Il Dong will make a scene again.

303
00:17:08,598 --> 00:17:11,618
Why can't my life ever settle down?

304
00:17:12,872 --> 00:17:14,877
I'm always fighting battles in midair.

305
00:17:16,605 --> 00:17:19,022
Anyway, be careful.

306
00:17:26,425 --> 00:17:30,165
These are gifts from Yeong Ju
and a friend of mine.

307
00:17:32,458 --> 00:17:33,973
Which friend?

308
00:17:38,665 --> 00:17:40,068
What a pretty bag.

309
00:17:41,622 --> 00:17:42,883
It's pretty.

310
00:17:43,171 --> 00:17:44,219
What's this?

311
00:17:46,291 --> 00:17:47,458
A scarf?

312
00:17:51,871 --> 00:17:53,166
I think this one's for you, Mom.

313
00:17:54,634 --> 00:17:55,634
For me?

314
00:17:57,365 --> 00:17:59,825
This is especially for you, Ms. Model.

315
00:17:59,845 --> 00:18:01,665
I think it'll look great on you.

316
00:18:01,952 --> 00:18:04,552
Have a lovely day with your daughter.

317
00:18:05,952 --> 00:18:06,952
Mom,

318
00:18:07,272 --> 00:18:08,761
don't tell me your friend's a man.

319
00:18:09,505 --> 00:18:11,229
Why is he acting like this?

320
00:18:12,970 --> 00:18:14,032
Is he married?

321
00:18:16,191 --> 00:18:17,211
Mom.

322
00:18:17,645 --> 00:18:19,388
What? Why?

323
00:18:19,462 --> 00:18:20,605
Don't worry.

324
00:18:20,792 --> 00:18:24,498
It's really not nice
to suspect me like that.

325
00:18:35,917 --> 00:18:37,977
Hey.

326
00:18:39,582 --> 00:18:41,634
This is your first birthday photo.

327
00:18:46,005 --> 00:18:50,086
Around your first birthday,
I harbored a lot of ill will.

328
00:18:50,721 --> 00:18:51,721
I'm sorry.

329
00:18:51,998 --> 00:18:53,823
Now I hope you'll be happy.

330
00:18:56,353 --> 00:18:58,591
How did she get this birthday photo?

331
00:18:59,458 --> 00:19:01,860
Did she curse you while looking at it?

332
00:19:04,038 --> 00:19:05,355
Why would you say that?

333
00:19:22,291 --> 00:19:23,538
Let go so we can talk.

334
00:19:23,539 --> 00:19:26,139
Please let go so we can talk.

335
00:19:27,927 --> 00:19:28,927
You're not, are you?

336
00:19:29,665 --> 00:19:31,432
- Not what?
- Involved with the General.

337
00:19:31,433 --> 00:19:33,757
Of course not.

338
00:19:33,918 --> 00:19:37,277
I've been a widow for less than a year.

339
00:19:37,992 --> 00:19:40,952
You stole a husband, grew old with him,
and now you call yourself a widow?

340
00:19:41,652 --> 00:19:42,652
Anyway,

341
00:19:43,037 --> 00:19:45,931
I'm too busy supporting my daughter
and myself.

342
00:19:47,478 --> 00:19:50,577
I've been deceived before,

343
00:19:50,902 --> 00:19:51,970
but I'll trust you.

344
00:19:52,430 --> 00:19:53,886
If you're lying,

345
00:19:54,154 --> 00:19:56,431
I'll grind your bones to dust.
Keep that in mind.

346
00:19:56,471 --> 00:19:57,471
Seriously...

347
00:19:58,298 --> 00:20:00,059
No matter what anyone says,

348
00:20:00,061 --> 00:20:01,751
I'm still faithful to my late husband.

349
00:20:01,752 --> 00:20:05,456
And I'm the one who got Yeong Ju
her wedding dress!

350
00:20:05,458 --> 00:20:07,258
Don't bring up that fool.

351
00:20:08,965 --> 00:20:10,256
As for the general,

352
00:20:10,650 --> 00:20:12,417
don't touch a hair on his head.

353
00:20:13,425 --> 00:20:14,812
Keep that in mind.

354
00:20:42,645 --> 00:20:44,793
Everything would've been fine...

355
00:20:46,032 --> 00:20:47,820
if Na Ji Ni hadn't shown up.

356
00:20:58,665 --> 00:21:00,482
You know my passcode,
so you can just walk in?

357
00:21:01,832 --> 00:21:04,129
Stop drinking.
You'll drink yourself to death.

358
00:21:06,531 --> 00:21:08,016
I'm going to die.

359
00:21:08,897 --> 00:21:10,840
My mom wants me dead,

360
00:21:11,382 --> 00:21:13,804
and so does everyone else.

361
00:21:14,325 --> 00:21:16,547
Na Ji Ni and Im Ji Hu too.

362
00:21:22,561 --> 00:21:24,247
(Thanks for everything. Don't feel guilty.
This is goodbye.)

363
00:21:24,592 --> 00:21:26,100
Then don't announce you're going to die.

364
00:21:26,632 --> 00:21:28,483
What's this? Are you seeking attention?

365
00:21:29,625 --> 00:21:31,644
You're crying out for someone
to stop you, right?

366
00:21:31,645 --> 00:21:32,980
Because I'm lonely.

367
00:21:33,461 --> 00:21:34,617
Because I'm sad.

368
00:21:35,410 --> 00:21:36,512
Does that bother you too?

369
00:21:36,698 --> 00:21:38,039
Is even that burden too much for you?

370
00:21:38,465 --> 00:21:41,718
Would you rather I died
without saying a word, then?

371
00:21:41,794 --> 00:21:42,891
Who said you should die?

372
00:21:44,365 --> 00:21:46,141
Use that courage to live instead.

373
00:21:46,985 --> 00:21:48,418
I kept living after losing my leg.

374
00:21:48,685 --> 00:21:50,491
You have all four limbs. Why can't you?

375
00:21:54,431 --> 00:21:55,504
Who is it?

376
00:21:58,912 --> 00:22:00,006
Mom?

377
00:22:08,705 --> 00:22:10,312
You haven't left yet?

378
00:22:10,697 --> 00:22:13,116
I heard you'd left this house.

379
00:22:13,238 --> 00:22:15,436
Do Hee, didn't you get your mom's call?

380
00:22:16,685 --> 00:22:17,850
That can't be.

381
00:22:25,185 --> 00:22:26,185
Mom,

382
00:22:26,690 --> 00:22:27,977
how could you do this?

383
00:22:28,265 --> 00:22:30,070
What do you mean, I have to move out?

384
00:22:30,758 --> 00:22:32,923
This place wasn't even nice,
and now you want it back too?

385
00:22:33,390 --> 00:22:34,390
Mom.

386
00:22:35,001 --> 00:22:36,001
Mom!

387
00:22:42,205 --> 00:22:44,522
She said she doesn't care
if I die on the streets.

388
00:22:45,154 --> 00:22:46,397
How could she...

389
00:22:47,458 --> 00:22:49,890
I'm not leaving, so don't come back.

390
00:22:49,892 --> 00:22:53,075
If she wants me dead so badly,
she can come and kill me herself.

391
00:22:53,145 --> 00:22:56,004
Okay. I'll talk to her.

392
00:23:06,811 --> 00:23:08,739
What kind of parents are they?

393
00:23:09,565 --> 00:23:11,013
Do Hee!

394
00:23:11,015 --> 00:23:14,258
Let go! I said let go!

395
00:23:20,052 --> 00:23:21,626
Why do you keep going after Na Ji Ni?

396
00:23:23,525 --> 00:23:26,170
He found out I lied about the bullying.

397
00:23:26,758 --> 00:23:28,140
Na Ji Ni must've told him.

398
00:23:29,212 --> 00:23:30,564
After that,

399
00:23:30,931 --> 00:23:32,225
he changed.

400
00:23:33,612 --> 00:23:34,939
You understand how I feel, right?

401
00:23:35,625 --> 00:23:37,705
You get why I want to kill her, right?

402
00:23:46,865 --> 00:23:48,538
I can't die alone.

403
00:23:52,911 --> 00:23:53,911
Do Hee.

404
00:24:03,545 --> 00:24:04,649
Do Hee!

405
00:24:05,272 --> 00:24:08,184
Director, thank you for everything.

406
00:24:41,952 --> 00:24:43,451
The package just arrived.

407
00:24:43,505 --> 00:24:45,885
I'll make sure Ji Ni gets
her birthday gift.

408
00:24:49,725 --> 00:24:51,085
(Do Hee)

409
00:24:55,492 --> 00:24:56,492
What?

410
00:24:56,564 --> 00:24:57,564
Ji Hu.

411
00:24:58,839 --> 00:25:00,510
Falling in love with Na Ji Ni...

412
00:25:00,992 --> 00:25:02,557
will be your biggest regret.

413
00:25:02,881 --> 00:25:04,344
I don't care if I regret it.

414
00:25:04,545 --> 00:25:06,345
I've chosen Ji Ni. I've made up my mind.

415
00:25:07,258 --> 00:25:08,876
Go live your own life now.

416
00:25:14,091 --> 00:25:16,014
My life is over.

417
00:25:17,838 --> 00:25:20,542
But I won't die alone. Remember that.

418
00:25:20,732 --> 00:25:21,948
What are you talking about?

419
00:25:22,852 --> 00:25:24,838
Have you been drinking? Where are you?

420
00:25:25,592 --> 00:25:27,167
I'm going to Ji Ni's birthday party.

421
00:25:30,452 --> 00:25:32,563
She should never have been born.

422
00:25:33,656 --> 00:25:34,656
Do Hee.

423
00:25:34,958 --> 00:25:35,958
Do Hee!

424
00:25:51,718 --> 00:25:53,286
One is from me.

425
00:25:53,685 --> 00:25:55,194
Thank you.

426
00:25:55,325 --> 00:25:57,195
The other is from Ji Hu.

427
00:25:57,532 --> 00:25:58,818
It came by courier.

428
00:26:00,445 --> 00:26:02,805
It's a gift. Just accept it.

429
00:26:07,998 --> 00:26:10,139
It's no fun with just the two of us.

430
00:26:12,038 --> 00:26:13,715
Want to go clubbing? It's been a while.

431
00:26:14,225 --> 00:26:15,225
Clubbing?

432
00:26:15,829 --> 00:26:18,827
- Sure.
- Get us a taxi.

433
00:26:19,365 --> 00:26:21,732
I'll put the cake in the fridge
before we leave.

434
00:26:21,954 --> 00:26:22,954
Okay.

435
00:26:24,003 --> 00:26:25,003
Thanks.

436
00:26:31,665 --> 00:26:32,756
Hello?

437
00:26:35,632 --> 00:26:36,632
Do Hee?

438
00:26:40,438 --> 00:26:41,547
Why? What about Do Hee?

439
00:27:46,098 --> 00:27:47,177
Ji Hu.

440
00:27:49,149 --> 00:27:50,199
Ji Hu.

441
00:28:30,801 --> 00:28:33,975
(Family Register)

442
00:28:33,976 --> 00:28:36,416
Why did Ji Hu jump in front of a car
for you?

443
00:28:36,417 --> 00:28:39,017
Shouldn't you be the one
dying in surgery instead?

444
00:28:39,018 --> 00:28:40,265
Please admit me right away.

445
00:28:40,266 --> 00:28:41,812
Don't allow anyone to visit me.

446
00:28:41,813 --> 00:28:43,993
You know the dashcam card's gone, right?

447
00:28:43,994 --> 00:28:45,956
- I'll never settle.
- Are you close to Do Do Hee?

448
00:28:45,958 --> 00:28:47,292
Did you know this would happen?

449
00:28:47,293 --> 00:28:48,599
You should've just let me die.

450
00:28:48,600 --> 00:28:51,760
If Do Do Hee gets out of this again,
I think I'll really kill her.

451
00:28:52,793 --> 00:28:54,793
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
